<section class="ed-section ed-cream" id="services"><div class="ed-wrap"><div class="ed-heading"><div><p class="ed-eyebrow">THE CONNECTED GUEST ACQUISITION SYSTEM</p><h2>More than traffic. A clearer path to direct bookings.</h2></div><p>Connect guest intent, persuasive property pages and booking-friendly experiences—with measurement that distinguishes interest from confirmed reservations.</p></div><div class="ed-automation-grid saas-services"><button type="button" class="saas-service" data-service="0" aria-pressed="true"><span class="ed-capability-icon">⌕</span><h3>Hotel SEO</h3><p>Reach guests researching destinations, property types and stays.</p><span class="saas-service-more">Explore capability ↗</span></button>
