<button type="button" class="saas-service" data-service="3" aria-pressed="false"><span class="ed-capability-icon">✦</span><h3>Property Storytelling</h3><p>Communicate your experience with accurate content and visuals.</p><span class="saas-service-more">Explore capability ↗</span></button>
<button type="button" class="saas-service" data-service="4" aria-pressed="false"><span class="ed-capability-icon">▣</span><h3>Guest CRM & Follow-Up</h3><p>Connect inquiries, opt-in guest communications and booking journeys.</p><span class="saas-service-more">Explore capability ↗</span></button>
<button type="button" class="saas-service" data-service="5" aria-pressed="false"><span class="ed-capability-icon">◈</span><h3>Booking Measurement</h3><p>Distinguish browsing, booking starts and confirmed reservations.</p><span class="saas-service-more">Explore capability ↗</span></button></div><div class="saas-service-panel" aria-live="polite"><div><span id="saas-service-label">CAPABILITY 01 / HOTEL SEO</span><h3 id="saas-service-title">Be discoverable for the stays you actually offer.</h3><p id="saas-service-body">Create useful property and destination pages that answer guest questions and make the next booking step obvious.</p></div><a href={booking} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Discuss this capability ↗</a></div></div></section>

<section class="ed-section ed-light" id="practices"><div class="ed-wrap"><div class="ed-heading"><div><p class="ed-eyebrow">01 / PROPERTY FIT</p><h2>Different properties. Different guest journeys.</h2></div><p>From distinctive boutique stays to group inquiries, property type changes messaging, conversion paths and what counts as a valuable lead.</p></div><div class="ed-program-grid"><div class="ed-program-options" role="group" aria-label="Hospitality property types"><button class="ed-program active" data-program="independent" aria-pressed="true"><span>01 / INDEPENDENT HOTEL</span><strong>Independent Hotels</strong><small>Drive direct reservation interest</small></button>
<button class="ed-program " data-program="boutique" aria-pressed="false"><span>02 / BOUTIQUE PROPERTY</span><strong>Boutique Hotels</strong><small>Distinctive stays and right-fit guests</small></button>
<button class="ed-program " data-program="resort" aria-pressed="false"><span>03 / RESORT & LEISURE</span><strong>Resorts</strong><small>Packages, experiences and seasonal demand</small></button>
<button class="ed-program " data-program="extended" aria-pressed="false"><span>04 / LONGER STAYS</span><strong>Extended-Stay Properties</strong><small>Suitability and longer booking windows</small></button>
