<button class="ed-program " data-program="group" aria-pressed="false"><span>06 / GROUPS & EVENTS</span><strong>Groups & Events</strong><small>Qualified venue and room-block inquiries</small></button></div><div class="ed-program-detail" aria-live="polite"><p class="ed-eyebrow">GUEST ACQUISITION BLUEPRINT / <span id="ed-program-number">01</span></p><div class="ed-program-symbol" id="ed-program-symbol" aria-hidden="true">⌂</div><h3 id="ed-program-title">Independent Hotels</h3><p id="ed-program-description">Help potential guests understand the property and book directly.</p><div class="ed-detail-line"><span>CHANNEL STRATEGY</span><strong id="ed-program-ads">Hotel SEO, local searches and booking-focused pages</strong></div><div class="ed-detail-line"><span>GUEST FIT</span><strong id="ed-program-fit">Location, travel dates and suitable room types</strong></div><div class="ed-detail-line"><span>NEXT STEP</span><strong id="ed-program-action">Guide guests to verified availability and rates</strong></div><a href={booking} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Discuss your property strategy ↗</a></div></div></div></section>

<section class="ed-section ed-navy" id="intake"><div class="ed-wrap"><div class="ed-heading"><div><p class="ed-eyebrow">02 / GUEST-TO-RESERVATION JOURNEY</p><h2>A website visit isn't a confirmed booking.</h2></div><p>Explore six stages of a practical direct-booking experience, from guest discovery through repeat stays.</p></div><div class="ed-journey"><div class="ed-steps" role="group" aria-label="Guest reservation journey"><button class="ed-step active" data-stage="0" aria-pressed="true"><span>01</span><strong>Discover</strong></button><button class="ed-step " data-stage="1" aria-pressed="false"><span>02</span><strong>Explore</strong></button><button class="ed-step " data-stage="2" aria-pressed="false"><span>03</span><strong>Check</strong></button><button class="ed-step " data-stage="3" aria-pressed="false"><span>04</span><strong>Consider</strong></button><button class="ed-step " data-stage="4" aria-pressed="false"><span>05</span><strong>Reserve</strong></button><button class="ed-step " data-stage="5" aria-pressed="false"><span>06</span><strong>Return</strong></button></div><div class="ed-stage-detail" aria-live="polite"><span id="ed-stage-kicker">STAGE 01 / DISCOVER</span><h3 id="ed-stage-title">Help the right travelers find your property.</h3><p id="ed-stage-body">Hotel SEO, relevant paid search and useful destination content bring qualified guest intent.</p><div class="ed-stage-metric"><span>WHAT TO REVIEW</span><strong id="ed-stage-metric">Relevant discovery and site visits</strong></div></div></div>
<div class="hotel-booking-row"><a class="ed-btn ed-btn-gold" href={booking}>Improve your direct-booking journey ↗</a></div>
</div></section>

<section class="ed-section ed-cream" id="automation"><div class="ed-wrap"><div class="ed-heading"><div><p class="ed-eyebrow">03 / GUEST EXPERIENCE &amp; FOLLOW-UP</p><h2>Make it easier to book—and easier to return.</h2></div><p>A clear guest journey combines the property website, booking engine, helpful responses and thoughtful post-stay communications.</p></div><div class="ed-automation-grid"><article tabindex="0"><span class="ed-capability-icon">◎</span><h3>Guest Questions</h3><p>Help guests find room details, check-in information, amenities and human assistance.</p></article><article tabindex="0"><span class="ed-capability-icon">◇</span><h3>Availability Paths</h3><p>Connect room and package pages to the property's existing booking engine.</p></article><article tabindex="0"><span class="ed-capability-icon">↺</span><h3>Consented Follow-Up</h3><p>Handle relevant inquiries and opt-in guest communication without excessive messaging.</p></article><article tabindex="0"><span class="ed-capability-icon">▣</span><h3>Booking Measurement</h3><p>Separate browsing and booking starts from verified direct reservations.</p></article></div><div class="ed-automation-demo"><div class="ed-demo-top"><span>GUEST INQUIRY / CONCEPT DEMO</span><i>ILLUSTRATIVE</i></div><div class="ed-chat"><p class="ed-chat-user">Do you have rooms for a long weekend, and is breakfast included?</p><p class="ed-chat-bot">You can review room availability and the property's current breakfast options on its official booking page. For specific requests, the hotel team can help.</p></div><p>Illustrative exchange only. No live booking integration, room availability or reservation is represented.</p></div>
<div class="hotel-booking-row"><a class="ed-btn ed-btn-gold" href={booking}>Discuss guest follow-up and automation ↗</a></div>
</div></section>

<section class="ed-section ed-light" id="planner"><div class="ed-wrap ed-planner-grid"><div><p class="ed-eyebrow">04 / DIRECT BOOKING PLANNER</p><h2>Explore how guest intent could translate into booking opportunities.</h2><p class="ed-muted">Adjust hypothetical stages of your website-to-booking journey. These values are illustrative, not actual hotel benchmarks, revenue forecasts or guarantees.</p><div class="ed-controls"><label for="ed-inquiries">Monthly relevant site visits <output id="ed-inquiries-label">500</output></label><input id="ed-inquiries" type="range" min="50" max="1000" step="25" value="500"/><label for="ed-qualified">Engaged property visitors <output id="ed-qualified-label">40%</output></label><input id="ed-qualified" type="range" min="10" max="90" step="5" value="40"/><label for="ed-contacted">Engaged visitors checking availability <output id="ed-contacted-label">35%</output></label><input id="ed-contacted" type="range" min="10" max="90" step="5" value="35"/><label for="ed-applications">Availability checks completing a reservation <output id="ed-applications-label">25%</output></label><input id="ed-applications" type="range" min="5" max="80" step="5" value="25"/></div></div><div class="ed-planner-result" aria-live="polite"><span>HYPOTHETICAL MONTHLY SCENARIO</span><div><small>Relevant visits</small><strong id="ed-out-inquiries">500</strong></div><div><small>Engaged visitors</small><strong id="ed-out-qualified">200</strong></div><div><small>Availability checks</small><strong id="ed-out-reached">70</strong></div><div class="ed-result-highlight"><small>Potential direct reservations</small><strong id="ed-out-applications">18</strong></div><p>Illustrative mathematical scenario only; actual confirmation requires booking-engine data. This does not represent expected bookings, occupancy or revenue.</p></div></div></section>

<section class="ed-section ed-navy ed-principles"><div class="ed-wrap"><div class="ed-heading"><div><p class="ed-eyebrow">05 / BUILT FOR HOSPITALITY</p><h2>Your property experience comes first. Marketing should reflect it.</h2></div></div><div class="ed-experience"><div class="ed-experience-number" aria-hidden="true">01 <small>CONNECTED GUEST JOURNEY</small></div><div><h3>Guest acquisition, booking paths and follow-up—connected.</h3><p>LeadsFlo works across search campaigns, landing pages, the guest journey and available CRM workflows. Your property team controls availability, rate decisions, guest service and the actual stay.</p><p>We don't imply access to live room inventory, invent property results or guarantee increased occupancy, reservations or revenue. Integrations are subject to actual supported capabilities and privacy requirements.</p></div></div>
